This license applies to the source code, scripts, configuration files, run
records and result files in this repository (the "Materials"). They accompany
the manuscript "CASE-RAG: Decision Models as Risk-Controlled Routers for
Retrieval-Augmented Generation" (the "Paper").

1. Evaluation period

   The terms in Sections 2 to 4 apply from the date the Materials were first
   made public until the Change Date. The Change Date is the earlier of:
   (a) the date on which the Paper is published in its final form by a
       peer-reviewed journal or conference; or
   (b) October 12, 2027.
   From the Change Date onward, Section 6 applies instead.

2. Permitted use during the evaluation period

   You may view, download, install and run the Materials, and modify them
   privately, solely for the following non-commercial purposes:
   (a) peer review of the Paper;
   (b) verifying or reproducing the results reported in the Paper; and
   (c) personal study and teaching.

